    metadata_path_spelling_observations=metadata_case_aliases,operational_authority=False,scientific_authority=False,
    Source_coverage='Whole module006-to007 reverse reconstruction. Only _i9_path reserved lookup/character predicate and one immutable23-name reserved constant differ. Every other function/class/method and all23 render/inverse algorithms, generic and exact legacy proof guards, Reader earlycaps/cache/budgets/clock/callbacks, local purpose indexes, immutable view and actualentry holds are byteexact. Fixture00598-case full bytes unchanged.',
    equivalence_reason='The identical23 builtin strings in immutable frozenset preserve membership. For every unchanged component, existence of ord<32 or membership in /:\"<>|?* equals regex search on inclusive C0 interval0..31 plus those eight literal characters. Initial path/type/length/drive guard, all component short-circuit predicates, errors and return value are otherwise exact. No new Unicode/DEL/C1 handling, normalization or result cache was introduced.',
    runtime_boundary='Source algebra only; no reviewed module/fixture/path/index/helper/oracle import/call/experiment or benchmark. Timeout5 has no child result: suiteentry, progress, compile/exec counts, audit/profile and aggregate run/fixture counts remain unknown. Four known saved failures and one unknown spent launch are retained; no passing suite is claimed.',
